<title>INDIA: India produces 12,318 tonnes of zinc in January.</title>
<headline>India produces 12,318 tonnes of zinc in January.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 12,318 tonnes of zinc in January 1997 as compared to 13,791 tonnes in December 1996, a government statement said on Monday.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed  January,1997    Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity   -------------   -------------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)    Actual	  Apr 96-Jan 97  Apr 95-Jan 96</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> HZL     149,000	9,589	   91,049	93,434</p>
<p> BZL	20,000	2,729	   24,231	23,146</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total   169,000     12,318	   115,280    116,580</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional</p>
</text>
